:: Tp pad 3 purchase {"position":"4100,550","size":"100,100"}
You get closer to the Teleportation pad to see a screen popup infront of you...

"You need to buy access to the Teleportation pad to use it."

<div class="UIButtons">
<<button "Buy access to the teleportation pad. | 5000 col">>
<<if $Coins >= 5000>>
<<set $Coins -= 5000>>
<<set $tppadTHREE to true>>
<<goto "Library 1">>
<<elseif $tppadTHREE == true>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You already bought the house!");
<</script>>
<<elseif $Coins <= 4999>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You dont have enough col!");
<</script>>
<</if>>
<</button>>
</div>

[[Go back|Library 1]]


